@startuml
title State Machine — OrderLine (UC-04)

state Closed {
  state Collected
  state Cancelled
  state Substituted
}

[*] --> BeingMade
note on link
  Assumed initial status. UC-04 does not cover
  how an order is recorded (Q-SH-11).
end note

BeingMade --> Ready : markReady
Ready --> Collected : recordCollection

BeingMade --> Cancelled : recordCustomerDecision\n[decision = Cancelled and reason supplied]
BeingMade --> Substituted : recordCustomerDecision\n[decision = Substituted and reason supplied]
Ready --> Cancelled : recordCustomerDecision\n[decision = Cancelled and reason supplied]
Ready --> Substituted : recordCustomerDecision\n[decision = Substituted and reason supplied]

legend bottom
  Any transition not shown is refused with InvalidStatusChange.
  A decision without a reason is refused with ReasonNotSupplied.
  The line status is checked before the reason.
  A refusal changes nothing.
  The order is Completed when all its lines are in Closed, otherwise Open.
end legend
@enduml
